From: Matthew Hollis <matt@hollisorganization.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 20:04:17 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] Reopen the same Hivemind handoff in a running app

---
 docs/iv-workspace.md                        |  2 +-
 package-lock.json                           |  4 ++--
 package.json                                |  2 +-
 src/renderer/src/components/IVWorkspace.jsx |  4 ++--
 src/service/iv-workspace-host.js            | 15 ++++++++++++---
 5 files changed, 18 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)

diff --git a/docs/iv-workspace.md b/docs/iv-workspace.md
index da7daee..2ee90be 100644
--- a/docs/iv-workspace.md
+++ b/docs/iv-workspace.md
@@ -1,6 +1,6 @@
 # Hivemind: local app continuity
 
-This build connects IV Outreach 0.12.3, IV Studio 1.1.13 and IV Signal 0.1.8 on one Windows account. It does not require a new account, server or provider subscription.
+This build connects IV Outreach 0.12.4, IV Studio 1.1.14 and IV Signal 0.1.10 on one Windows account. It does not require a new account, server or provider subscription.
 
 ## Use it
 
